          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "A Septuagesima usque ad Pascha, loco Alleluia, dicitur: Laus tibi, Domine, Rex aeternae gloriae.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymnus",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O Ignati, militantis Clara fax Ecclesiae! O Xaveri, daventis Sidus et lux Indiae! Vos honorent, quotquot ambit Phoebus orbis climata, Quaqua pontum sero lambit, Quaqua tollit lumina.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Sapientiam ipsorum narrent populi, et laudem eorum nuntiet Ecclesia. Eccli. 44. 15.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. In omnem terram exivit sonus eorum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0012",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et in fines orbis terrae verba eorum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0013",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0014",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Deus, qui glorificantes te glorificas, et in Sanctorum tuorum honoribus honoraris: concede propitius, ut qui beatorum Ignatii et Xaverii Confessorum tuorum merita veneramur, eorum pia apud te patrocinia sentiamus. Per Dominum nostrum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0015",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine, exaudi orationem meam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0016",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et clamor meus ad te veniat.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            520
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0017",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Benedicamus Domino.",
